cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these demos, please cite them and the papers they implement."
title: "Privacy engineering: interactive research demos"
abstract: >-
  Four interactive web demos (Python, FastAPI, WebSocket) of the privacy-engineering research
  of Catarina Silva at IEETA, University of Aveiro: ASAP Latent Map (autoencoder detection of
  privacy-harmful Android apps), PsDC Categorizer (automatic data categorization and measured
  privacy value), DP vs Profiling (differential privacy against re-identification and profiling)
  and Elastic Privacy Map (self-adaptive location privacy).
type: software
authors:
